WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Sova drives the local demo: enter an incorrect password and assert that the rejection message is visible.

00:09.000 --> 00:19.000
sova save generates the Playwright test from the recorded flow. The unchanged app passes the gate.

00:19.000 --> 00:28.000
sova mutate removes the password condition on purpose. The rejection test catches this break.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.920
Sova restores the original source. The same test passes again with no retries.
